OL,3,GNEWSARoad shut after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A14 in Northamptonshire was
OL,7,Fshut after a multi-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FThe westbound carriageway was closed
OL,10,Fnear Kelmarsh between junctions two and
OL,11,Fone. Both lanes have since reopened,
OL,12,FNational Highways said.
OL,14,FAn assessment of the central
OL,15,Freservation was needed, the roads
OL,16,Fagency added.
OL,18,FDrivers have been warned there are
OL,19,Fresidual delays.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
